routes, etc.) on `client_0`, `dns_pod0`, and `webserver0_pod0`.\n3. **Service Status:**\n   - Confirm the operational status of DNS and HTTP services on the respective hosts.\n4. **Link and Interface Status:**\n   - Examine the status of network interfaces and links between routers and hosts.\n\nThis report highlights the current state of the network and identifies areas requiring further investigation to pinpoint the root cause of the connectivity issues.", "generation_info": {"finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3229, "output_tokens": 546, "total_tokens": 3775, "input_token_details": {"audio": 0, "cache_read": 1792}, "output_token_details": {"audio": 0, "reasoning": 0}}}
